PaymentId_Payments_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── it should hash the type hash and chain id and this contract and job nonce and executor and recipient and token and amount and kind and document hash
├── it should ignore the item's own paymentId field
├── when any one of the hashed fields changes
│   └── it should return a different id
└── when the same item is hashed on another chain or by another Payments contract
    └── it should return a different id
